+- **Depends on:** none
+
+**Files:**
+- Modify: `crates/superstate-agent/Cargo.toml:11-17`
+
+**Interfaces:**
+- Consumes: none
+- Produces: `libc` available on Unix targets for POSIX process group signalling.
+
