+
+Edit `crates/superstate-agent/Cargo.toml` to add:
+```toml
+[target.'cfg(unix)'.dependencies]
+libc = "0.2"
+```
+
+- [ ] **Step 2: Verify `Cargo.toml` parses and workspace compiles**
+
+Run:
+```bash
